# Track the paths-conditional lint-surface rule (moved out of AGENTS.md to
# keep always-loaded memory under the 20KB threshold) even though the user's
# global gitignore excludes .claude/. Un-ignore the directory chain first —
# git cannot re-include a file under an excluded directory.
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/rules/
.claude/rules/*
!.claude/rules/lint-surface.md
